Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; X Tweet Saver: remove ONLY this extensions slot (Chrome, needs admin).
; Slot "3" is reserved for X Tweet Saver ("1" = Inbox Clipper, "2" = Voluptas). Never reuse another slot: same name overwrites.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\ExtensionInstallForcelist]
"3"=-
